<title>UK: ABP yr profit up 5.8 percent at 93.5 mln.</title>
<headline>ABP yr profit up 5.8 percent at 93.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.9		   vs 17.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.25		   vs 3.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.75		   vs 6.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     93.5		   vs 88.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   247.2		  vs 235.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 95 million and 100.3 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Associated British Ports Plc</p>
